# User Stories and Acceptance Criteria

### US01 — Document Intake
As a procurement coordinator, I want documents to be captured in a standardized format so that submissions can be tracked consistently.

Acceptance criteria:
- Each submission has a unique ID.
- Department and document type are recorded.
- Received date is captured.

### US02 — Missing Information
As a coordinator, I want incomplete documents flagged so that I can follow up.

Acceptance criteria:
- Missing fields are identified.
- The document is marked incomplete.
- The record appears in the exception view.

### US03 — AI Classification
As an administrative user, I want AI to suggest document categories so that manual classification effort can be reduced.

Acceptance criteria:
- AI displays its suggested classification.
- Uncertain results require human review.
- AI cannot independently approve documents.

### US04 — Management Reporting
As a manager, I want a dashboard showing document status so that I can monitor workload and outstanding items.

Acceptance criteria:
- Status counts are displayed.
- Department filters work.
- Outstanding documents are identifiable.
